2	//! EduGate Rustica – a lightweight, production-ready API gateway for Ed-Tech back-ends.
3	//!
4	//! The executable demonstrates classic micro-service gateway patterns:
5	//!   * REST-oriented, versioned entry points (`/api/v{n}`)
6	//!   * Transparent error mapping from downstream services
7	//!   * Response caching for “hot” resources such as public course catalogs
8	//!   * Lightweight monitoring via Prometheus metrics + `tracing` spans
9	//!
10	//! NOTE: Most configuration is driven by environment variables so that the
11	//!       binary remains 12-factor-compliant and cloud-portable.
12	//!
13	//! ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
14	//!  Env-vars
15	//! ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
16	//!  * `COURSE_SVC_URL`  – base URL of the course micro-service
17	//!  * `RES_CACHE_TTL`   – positive integer; cache TTL in seconds (default: 60)
18	//!  * `RUST_LOG`        – standard log level filter (e.g. `info,edugate=debug`)
19	//!
20	//!  Run example:
21	//!    $ COURSE_SVC_URL=http://localhost:9001 \
22	//!      cargo run --release
23	//!
24	//! ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
25	//!  Dependencies (see `Cargo.toml`):
26	//!   actix-web, reqwest, serde, serde_json, moka, tracing, tracing-subscriber,
27	//!   prometheus, anyhow, thiserror
28	//!
