2	//! models.rs
3	//!
4	//! Central data structures shared across the EduGate Rustica API-gateway.
5	//! –––
6	//! The gateway is intentionally thin: it does not own business domain
7	//! entities; instead, it focuses on request/response envelopes, error
8	//! abstraction, cache metadata, and lightweight monitoring probes.
9	//!
10	//! All structs are `Serialize`/`Deserialize` to allow seamless propagation
11	//! through e.g. a distributed cache or an async message bus.
12	
13	#![allow(clippy::module_name_repetitions)]
